data:{\\\"confidence\\\":9} -->\\nP2: When a reachable MCP module re-exports or dynamically imports another local module, this adoption gate never scans that runtime dependency. Traverse export declarations and dynamic-import specifiers, or use the TypeScript module resolver, before accepting the graph.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At scripts/verify-mcpfn-adoption.mjs, line 151:\\n\\n<comment>When a reachable MCP module re-exports or dynamically imports another local module, this adoption gate never scans that runtime dependency. Traverse export declarations and dynamic-import specifiers, or use the TypeScript module resolver, before accepting the graph.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -72,34 +76,157 @@ if (actualDigest !== contract.sourceDigest) {\\n+    reachable.set(path, parsed);\\n+    for (const statement of parsed.statements) {\\n+      if (\\n+        ts.isImportDeclaration(statement) &&\\n+        ts.isStringLiteral(statement.moduleSpecifier) &&\\n+        statement.moduleSpecifier.text.startsWith(\\\".\\\")\\n</file context>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n✅ Addressed in [`894beef`](https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/commit/894beef6b6c384ec2805c07861267fcbc200aad7)\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/7#discussion_r3885946703\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": 3885946705,\n    \"user\": \"cubic-dev-ai[bot]\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-08-29T07:35:57Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-29T10:02:34Z\",\n    \"path\": \"scripts/verify-mcpfn-adoption.mjs\",\n    \"line\": null,\n    \"original_line\": 120,\n    \"commit_id\": \"f512980e42247b92388bc72185d92f9869ce51fa\",\n    \"original_commit_id\": \"f512980e42247b92388bc72185d92f9869ce51fa\",\n    \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n    \"body\": \"<!-- cubic:v=8fac6017-2109-49a5-80e7-170bc0c89e7d -->\\n<!-- cubic:review-run=39359766-c5d4-4a6c-b002-7b5de7d28b34 -->\\n<!-- metadata: