0acd42e7f`\\n    \\n\\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\\n<br/>\\n\\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\\n- Open a pull request for review\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\n- Comment \\\"@codex review\\\".\\n\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \\\"@codex address that feedback\\\".\\n            \\n</details>\",\n      \"commit\": \"80acd42e7ff1b83eb5c4934c7e9093cf991e97f0\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"pullfrog\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-08-29T06:28:36Z\",\n      \"body\": \"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> `80acd42` fixes the runtime review findings cleanly, but the PR description now misstates the reviewed dependency pin, draft state, and integration result. Reconcile that publication record with the current head before merge.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** I reviewed the remediation since the prior Pullfrog review at `f61b249`, together with the complete updated PR diff and the pinned McpFn hook contract.\\n\\n- **Pre-resolution authorization limits**: Added endpoint-and-network limits before registered or remote client lookup, while preserving client-and-network token limits for both authorization-code and refresh grants.\\n- **Removed-route enforcement**: Added AuthFn route matching and exact `404`/`ROUTE_NOT_FOUND` assertions for the deleted registration-management surface.\\n- **Runtime artifact verification**: Extended the McpFn digest to executed `dist` artifacts and made path ordering and labels deterministic across platforms.\\n- **Conformance evidence reconciliation**: Matched executable scenario baselines to exact emitted non-success check IDs and retained schema-versioned evidence.\\n- **Dependency repin**: Advanced the external McpFn worktree contract to `61a82af3` with its updat