fix(mcp): satisfy static analysis quality gates\\n  - f43b982 — chore(mcp): repin after provider workspace fix\\n  - c8badcf — chore(mcp): repin after OAuth workspace fix\\n  - 5765b9e — chore(mcp): advance pinned McpFn source\\n  - 457b9cd — feat(mcp): adopt McpFn runtime and authorization\\n- Prior pullfrog review: f512980 (https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/7#pullrequestreview-5057278868)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/skillplane/7?action=fix&review_id=5057615990) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/skillplane/7?action=fix-approved&review_id=5057615990) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/actions/runs/33246853577/job/99085712486) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\n      \"commit\": \"894beef6b6c384ec2805c07861267fcbc200aad7\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"pullfrog\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-08-29T11:44:39Z\",\n      \"body\": \"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The remediation addresses both prior findings, but the publication boundary still identifies the previous McpFn commit as the release-gated dependency.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** I reviewed `a767b05` since the prior Pullfrog review at `894beef`, together with the complete updated PR diff.\\n\\n- **Source-pin evidence** — Repinned the McpFn worktree contract to `5705aad` and reconciled the tracked completion record while retaining the same consumed-package digest.\\n- **Metadata-document route coverage** — Replaced direct helper coverage with a compatibility `/oauth/authorize` test that