s and link targets, then replaced text matching with TypeScript module-graph inspection.\\n- **Tightened OAuth behavior**: Required non-empty dynamic client names, restored endpoint-specific rate-limit errors, and explicitly enabled normalized HTTP loopback issuers for controlled tests.\\n- **Restored integration validation**: Repinned McpFn with the loopback issuer support that allows the full integration suite to initialize while retaining non-loopback HTTP rejection.\\n- **Stabilized conformance evidence**: Rejected oversized artifacts before reading them and retained the prior completion timestamp when regenerated evidence is unchanged.\\n- **Reconciled publication metadata**: Updated the PR description and completion record to the current dependency pin, green integration result, and ready-for-review state.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against f512980;\\nif commits have landed on codex/ski-6-mcpfn-runtime since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 35\\n- Commits reviewed: 1\\n- Base: main (c13917c)\\n- Head: codex/ski-6-mcpfn-runtime (f512980)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - f512980 — fix(ski-6): close latest review findings\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 80acd42 (https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/7#pullrequestreview-5057169707)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/skillplane/7?action=fix&review_id=5057278868) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigge