al projection of validated Client ID Metadata Document clients and redirect URIs before AuthFn authorization begins.\\n- **Production-path adoption gate** — Reworked AST verification to follow the registered `/mcp` callback, imported server factory, exported declaration, and invoked web-standard handler.\\n- **Cross-platform verification** — Added pnpm lifecycle invocation on Windows and expanded local TypeScript module traversal across exports, dynamic imports, and extension variants.\\n- **Dependency repin** — Advanced the reviewed McpFn worktree contract to `8c79a06` with digest `sha256:9c0919b...`.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 894beef;\\nif commits have landed on codex/ski-6-mcpfn-runtime since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 35\\n- Commits reviewed: 33\\n- Base: main (c13917c)\\n- Head: codex/ski-6-mcpfn-runtime (894beef)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 894beef — fix(ski-6): address refreshed PR feedback\\n  - f512980 — fix(ski-6): close latest review findings\\n  - 80acd42 — fix(ski-6): address MCP runtime review findings\\n  - f61b249 — chore(mcpfn): pin reviewed auth fix\\n  - fbd6605 — chore(mcpfn): pin final review head\\n  - 7695839 — chore(mcpfn): pin rewritten review head\\n  - 75bc660 — chore(mcpfn): pin security-clean review head\\n  - 62c8fc9 — chore(mcpfn): pin artifact review head\\n  - 64f79ea — chore(mcpfn): pin final review head\\n  - 58e52ff — chore(mcpfn): pin isolated reconnect head\\n  - 110a27a — chore(mcpfn): pin bounded protocol head\\n  - 18acfb1 — chore(mcpfn): pin final reviewed runtime head\\n  - 9d49787 — chore(mcpfn): pin bounded inventory head\\n  - 93219d4 — chore(mcpfn): pin hardened CI head\\n  - 863d564 — chore(mcpfn): pin CI review fix\\n  - 6b6fe5f — chore(mcpfn): pin review completion fixes\\n  - ddae626 — chore(mcpfn): pin O